  "details": "I use Lighthouse system FBT. Sometimes a device, usually a Tundra tracker as well. It turns on when plugged into USB and I don't wanna get up when I'm sleeping here. So I'll try to use GoGo or find Sit/Stand in the menu. \n\nAnd that's no fault of VRC, but of Steam / Tundra.\n\nBut...\n\nPlease put a shortcut near sit/stand to turn FBT off, because it takes too long to toggle it in the gear menu, near the bottom.\n\nIt's functional, but not cozy.\n\nWhile you're at it, please add a shortcut to change camera near distance.",
